    "detailed_description": "Immerse yourself in the enchanted world of Medieval Thieves, an epic VR adventure that will take you to a thief's battle with soldiers. You will immerse yourself in a meticulously built medieval city where danger lurks around every corner.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWith stunning virtual reality visuals, the game offers an unparalleled level of immersion. Put on your VR headset and play as a master thief, outsmarting clever guards as you make your way through intricately designed castles.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKey Features:<br />\r\n- Thrilling VR RPG gameplay: Experience the thrill of being a warrior. Use bows and swords flexibly to take down enemies.<br />\r\n- Complex level design: Fight in a straight line with minions. With a building design of medieval style buildings and dense trees<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAre you ready to embark on an unforgettable adventure as the Medieval Thief? Download now and unleash your inner rogue!",
    "about_the_game": "Immerse yourself in the enchanted world of Medieval Thieves, an epic VR adventure that will take you to a thief's battle with soldiers. You will immerse yourself in a meticulously built medieval city where danger lurks around every corner.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWith stunning virtual reality visuals, the game offers an unparalleled level of immersion. Put on your VR headset and play as a master thief, outsmarting clever guards as you make your way through intricately designed castles.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKey Features:<br />\r\n- Thrilling VR RPG gameplay: Experience the thrill of being a warrior. Use bows and swords flexibly to take down enemies.<br />\r\n- Complex level design: Fight in a straight line with minions. With a building design of medieval style buildings and dense trees<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAre you ready to embark on an unforgettable adventure as the Medieval Thief? Download now and unleash your inner rogue!",
    "short_description": "&quot;Medieval Thief&quot;, a thrilling single-player virtual reality game that takes you on a role-playing adventure set in a medieval world of darkness and secrecy. As a cunning thief, you will be equiped swords, bows and arrows to fend off soldiers trying to protect Medieval treasures",
